IMPORTANT: Assigning an ENTIRE list ot another varaible does NOT copy the list; both varaibles refer to the same list, so if you change 1 thing, it changes for both vars. 
BUT, assigning a SINGLE element to a  new varaible gives the new variable that elements value (even if you change it in the original variable, it stays the same in the new variable because it is a copy)

